{"id": "component/cmp-alpha-widget", "type": "component", "slug": "cmp-alpha-widget", "path": "knowledge/components/cmp-alpha-widget.md", "frontmatter": {"type": "component", "created": "2026-01-15", "updated": "2026-01-15", "draft": false, "name": "Alpha Widget", "description": "The default build target runs `dotnet test Example.Tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory = Smoke Tests\"`, and any failure fails the build. The other UI fixtures and the whole API project are built but never run by the checked-in build."}, "body": "<!-- one paragraph \u2014 what this is and where its boundary runs. `kind` says whether we can change it or only react to it; `depends_on` carries what breaks when it does. -->\n\n## Responsibilities\n\n<!-- what this owns, and \u2014 as sharply \u2014 what it deliberately does not -->\n\n## Interfaces\n\n<!-- how callers reach it; hang the machine spec (OpenAPI/AsyncAPI) off `resource` -->\n\n## Operational notes\n\n<!-- how it fails, how that shows up, and what to do about it -->"}
